Z||000000||sqoach||09-19-2001||05:39 PM||||What do ya think?<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grant_wheel.JPG"> <P>Only thing I don't like about it is that it sticks out a little further than the stock wheel, due to the adapter you have to get. There has to be some way to fix that. But I can live with it for now.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">          <BR>^^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^^<BR><LI><FONT SIZE="1">84 SE (FOR SALE)*SOLD(?)*<BR><LI>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR><LI>86 SC</FONT>||||reg||10
Z||000001||Jake_Dragon||09-19-2001||06:19 PM||||I like it, what was the final price?<P>I hate where the wheel is at on mine.<BR>With the seat all the way back for leg room the wheel is just out of my comfort zone.<BR>Is that a 2 inch adapter?<P>Anyway I like it looks cool. <P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://web.tampabay.rr.com/jakedragon" TARGET=_blank>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/logo.gif">         </A>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/halfpole_4.gif"> ||||reg||1
