Z||000015||My7Fieros||09-21-2001||02:16 AM||||Im not big on aftermarket steering wheels, but that one looks pretty good. One thing I'd do is get the thick round black Fiero emblem stick on thing to put in place of that silly "gt" or whatever in the middle. Rodney Dickman actually sells those. That way it'd look more stock. Just a thought.<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||1
